  "axis": "[macOS-MLX research-signal] train telemetry; frozen CPU-torch facets = d_seg authority; no contest claim without upstream/evaluate.py on byte-closed archive",
  "fire_guard_note": "guard now matches microbatch_hygiene/microbatch_chunk_cache/verdict_batch_size/float_warmup_steps (d14391b1d4); the mem-probe MUST run with the full saturated flag set so the receipt's argv_config carries them \u2014 an old-schema receipt will correctly REFUSE",
